    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd28418693d4480d",
      "translationZh": "早在 7 月，我就在这里分享过 LokalBot。这是一款免费、开源的 Mac 应用，可以录制你的会议，并每天汇总你的活动，所有处理都在设备本地完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aea13abad0228075",
      "translationZh": "0.9.2 今天发布了。自 7 月以来，我对其中的每个模型都进行了基准测试，并将大多数默认模型换成了更小的模型。现在整套技术栈的大小为 6.8 GB：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37e389433b88a510",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3-ASR 1.7B（MLX，8-bit）：语音转写",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11b6d982c3c6981b",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 3（Core ML）：识别谁在什么时候说话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5ce7dbd1d91ee55",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.5 4B Q4_K_M（llama.cpp）：笔记和行动事项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "955706000054bbf5",
      "translationZh": "Harrier 0.6B Q8_0：用于搜索的嵌入向量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c46b49b5f79f502e",
      "translationZh": "LFM2.5 1.2B Q4_K_M：在任意应用中自动补全",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d10ab24f22dc1c8",
      "translationZh": "Apple Vision：屏幕 OCR（需主动启用）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6a6749d618ac344",
      "translationZh": "以下是我的 M4 Max（48 GB）上的一些数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5bcf545119b35688",
      "translationZh": "在热启动状态下，将 26 分钟的会议处理成完整笔记耗时 33 秒，解码速度约为 85 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6f3d4dbb3122ab25",
      "translationZh": "在 AMI 上，说话人错误率从 43.4% 降到了 14.6% DER。这是与我之前的 pyannote 配置相比的结果，因此它更多反映的是我的配置，而不是 pyannote 本身。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5208018b99e9b885",
      "translationZh": "自动补全的 p95 延迟从 1.83 秒（Gemma 4 E4B）降到了 0.49 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "468d0a635a28c3b2",
      "translationZh": "此外还有一个只读的 MCP 服务器和 CLI，默认关闭，可供 Claude Code 或任何其他 MCP 客户端从你的会议中获取上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "060e9f4523eaacb9",
      "translationZh": "我还没有任何 16 GB 或其他 M 系列设备上的数据。如果你有这样的设备，尤其是 M5 或 M6，我很想看看你的测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37179d416ee81900",
      "translationZh": "我也试过用 MiniCPM5 2B 生成笔记。它更小、速度更快，但在生成一份摘要时陷入了重复，还把行动项分配给了错误的人。我保留了 Qwen3.5 4B 作为默认模型，因为省下几秒钟，不值得冒弄错谁答应做什么的风险。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34155f2311b43617",
      "translationZh": "所有基准测试数据及其来源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
